## btca

Trigger: user says "use btca" (for codebase/docs questions).

Run:
- btca ask -t <tech> -q "<question>"

Available <tech>: nextjs, tailwindcss, convex, ai-sdk, tldraw, svelte, daytona, tanstack-docs, supermemory, openai-agents-js, openai-realtime-agents

## how to strucutre your asks:
you can only ask question about the tech your refering to, if you need to know about multiple technoligies do mulitple command for each technolgy

and you cant ask question about thr project your working on for example 
- btca ask -t nextjs -q "is the current implimentation best pratice for nextjs" 
we cant do that since btca has no context about our code only the tech you refred like nextjs